{"unit_id": "tag:0817:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。\n设<MATH_0003>是整（integral）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-代数（algebra）。\n则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>是其有限（finite）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-子代数（subalgebras）的有向余极限（directed colimit），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007>是有限（finite）且有限表示（finitely presented）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）的一个直接余极限（colimit）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "直接余极限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理开头所设的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "对概形的第一项假设。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "对概形的第二项假设。"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "修饰引理开头所给的代数。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰引理开头所给的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引理开头所给的代数。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "修饰第一项结论中的子代数。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰第一项结论中的子代数。"}, {"source_term": "subalgebras", "target_term": "子代数", "context": "第一项结论中的余极限由这些子代数构成。"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "第一项结论中子代数的余极限。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第二项结论中各代数满足的第一个条件。"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "第二项结论中各代数满足的第二个条件。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰第二项结论中构成余极限的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第二项结论中的余极限由这些代数构成。"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "直接余极限", "context": "第二项结论中的 colimit 带有修饰语 direct，故译作直接余极限。"}], "notes": []}
